1
00:00:00,353 --> 00:00:03,803
(Sheldon:)On the one hand, the Xbox One
has a better camera,

2
00:00:03,957 --> 00:00:06,597
(Sheldon:)but the PS4 has
a removable hard drive.

3
00:00:07,794 --> 00:00:09,134
(Sheldon:)Thoughts?

4
00:00:10,397 --> 00:00:12,037
(Amy:)I can't feel my legs.

5
00:00:14,968 --> 00:00:16,108
(Sheldon:)Oh...

6
00:00:16,136 --> 00:00:18,416
(Store assistant:)I'm sorry, guys, but the store
closed five minutes ago.

7
00:00:19,372 --> 00:00:20,972
(Sheldon:)But I haven't decided yet.

8
00:00:21,141 --> 00:00:23,621
(Store assistant:)You'll have to come back tomorrow.
The registers are closed.

9
00:00:28,315 --> 00:00:31,425
(Amy:)Let's get you some food.
You'll feel better after you eat.

10
00:00:31,585 --> 00:00:33,325
(Bernadette:)Okay.

11
00:00:33,486 --> 00:00:37,336
(Amy:)What do you want like, Thai food?
A burger?

12
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,470
I don't know!

13
00:00:50,337 --> 00:00:52,177
Hey look, a quarter!

14
00:01:01,815 --> 00:01:02,855
(Costume guy:)How's that feel?

15
00:01:03,016 --> 00:01:05,296
(Leonard:)Great.
Not like regret at all.

16
00:01:08,688 --> 00:01:10,028
(Sheldon:)Penny?

17
00:01:10,857 --> 00:01:11,857
We're working together!

18
00:01:13,493 --> 00:01:15,033
Awesome!

